<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S4.T1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance comparison on RoboCasa <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Nasiriany et al., 2024</a>)</cite></span>. We report the average success rate (%) over 50 trials on 24 tasks, including 8 pick-and-place tasks, trained with varying numbers of demonstrations. Results for our methods are averaged over 3 random seeds, while baseline results are taken as reported in the original paper.
<math id="S4.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> indicates reproduced performance, and <math id="S4.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="*" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∗</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">*</annotation></semantics></math> indicates results with additional joint training before applying our test-time scaling framework.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
