<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Detail Results on Efficient Deployment Strategy</h2>

<figure id="A3.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span><span id="A3.T10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Detailed inference latency comparison on LIBERO-Object <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2023</a>)</cite>.</span>
This table presents the detailed results corresponding to Figure <a href="#S4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 4.3 Ablation Studies and Analyses ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Verifier-free Test-Time Sampling for Vision Language Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, comparing vanilla MG-Select and MG-Select with the single prefill strategy.
We report the average inference latency over 10 episodes for each of 5 random seeds, across different numbers of <math id="A3.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> candidates.</figcaption>
